\pard\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1\par\b\f0\fs22\lang9\tab Rufus 4.9 (2025.06.15) [BUGFIX RELEASE]\b0\par\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sl276\slmult1\fs16 Fix downloads from https://rufus.ie no longer working due to recent GitHub server changes\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix unofficial Windows ISOs, with single index WIMs, not presenting the WUE dialog\par

\pard\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1\par\b\f0\fs22\lang9\tab Still from Rufus 4.8 (2025.06.11)\b0\par\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sl276\slmult1\fs16 Switch to wimlib for all WIM image processing:\par
\pard\sl276\slmult1\tab - Greatly speeds up image analysis when opening Windows ISOs\par
\pard\sl276\slmult1\tab - Can speed up Windows To Go drive creation (But won't do miracles if you have a crap drive)\par
\pard\sl276\slmult1\tab - Might help with Parallels limitations on Mac (But Rufus on Parallels is still UNSUPPORTED)\par
\pard\sl276\slmult1\tab - Enables the splitting of >4GB files with Alt-E (But still WAY SLOWER than using UEFI:NTFS)\par
\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sl276\slmult1\fs16Switch to using Visual Studio binaries everywhere, due to MinGW DLL delay-loading limitations\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Add more exceptions for Linux ISOs that restrict themselves to DD mode (Nobara, openSUSE, ...)\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve reporting of UEFI bootloaders in the log, with info on the Secure Boot status\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix an issue with size limitations when writing an uncompressed VHD back to the same drive\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix a crash when opening the log with the 32-bit MinGW compiled version\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix commandline parameters not being forwarded to original Windows setup.exe\par

\pard\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1\par}
